### Uji REST API Warung UMKM
### Pakai ekstensi VS Code "REST Client" (klik "Send Request"), atau salin ke Postman/Thunder Client.

@base = http://localhost:3000/menu

### READ - semua menu
GET {{base}}

### CREATE - tambah menu
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Soto Ayam",
  "harga": 17000,
  "stok": 12,
  "kategori": "Makanan",
  "deskripsi": "Soto bening khas Lamongan"
}

### READ - satu menu
GET {{base}}/1

### UPDATE - ubah sebagian field
PATCH {{base}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "harga": 19000
}

### UPDATE - kurangi stok 3 (pakai angka positif untuk menambah)
PATCH {{base}}/1/stok
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jumlah": -3
}

### DELETE - hapus menu
DELETE {{base}}/1

### QUERY LANJUTAN (where) - filter kategori + cari nama
GET {{base}}?kategori=Minuman&cari=es

### QUERY LANJUTAN (where) - stok menipis (<= 5)
GET {{base}}?stokMaks=5

### QUERY LANJUTAN (count/groupBy/aggregate) - statistik
GET {{base}}/statistik

### VALIDASI - harus 400
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "",
  "harga": -1,
  "kategori": "Sepatu"
}
